1Sa 19:1 , Jonathan discloses his father's purpose to kill David;
1Sa 19:4 , He persuades his father to reconciliation;
1Sa 19:8 , By reason of David's good success in a new war, Saul's malicious rage breaks out against him;
1Sa 19:12 , Michal deceives her father with an image in David's bed;
1Sa 19:18 , David comes to Samuel in Naioth;
1Sa 19:20 , Saul's messengers sent to take David
1Sa 19:22 , and Saul himself, prophesy.
